      "name": "Stark",
      "created_at": "2025-08-26T09:39:02.087Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi,<br>\nI created an Item without enabling Has Serial No, and already made some invoices/stock entries. Later I realized this item must be tracked with Serial Numbers.</p>\n<p>Since ERPNext doesn’t allow changing this after transactions, what is the best practice to handle this?</p>\n<p>Thanks!</p>",
