      "username": "ahsantareen",
      "name": "Ahsan Tareen",
      "created_at": "2025-08-26T13:18:52.121Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/stark\">@Stark</a></p>\n<p>You can not update item type if you have already recorded transaction on it.</p>\n<p>You have to either recall those transaction or disable it and create new one with correct item master definition.</p>",
