      "id": 482669,
      "username": "szufisher",
      "name": "szufisher",
      "created_at": "2025-09-30T14:03:01.680Z",
      "cooked": "<ol>\n<li>\n<p>using stock entry: material issue  to make the stock balance 0</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>use system console frappe.db.set_value(“Item”, “your-item-code”, “has_serial_no”, 1) to activate has_serial<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/7/57843d9d2ffd4fa185c1caeac74be060a5104874.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/57843d9d2ffd4fa185c1caeac74be060a5104874\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/7/57843d9d2ffd4fa185c1caeac74be060a5104874_2_631x500.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"cucRAhOXxZVWpiZFgCTQDCs7B1q\" width=\"631\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/7/57843d9d2ffd4fa185c1caeac74be060a5104874_2_631x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/7/57843d9d2ffd4fa185c1caeac74be060a5104874_2_946x750.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/7/57843d9d2ffd4fa185c1caeac74be060a5104874.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F7F7F7\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1032×817 17.9 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>move the stock back by stock entry material receipt, now you can assign serial number</p>\n</li>\n</ol>",
